d29ddd2eabb52ffa2c0b42af1562.mp4?t=1731399635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource collection and construction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can construct buildings with resources collected from dungeons and islands.<br></li><li>Make various buildings to make it easier to escape.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061300/extras/2d70ff479b495efb2e95003dc6239f29.poster.avif?t=1731399635\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061300/extras/2d70ff479b495efb2e95003dc6239f29.apng?t=1731399635\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Interesting story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet NPC's and follow the story as you explore 4 islands.<br></li><li>Will Kevin and Cheese eventually escape the island?<br></li><li>The warmth of lights and shadows on a classical pixel art style is waiting for you!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061300/extras/eb53668452642e1093695525555f079c.poster.avif?t=1731399635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061300/extras/eb53668452642e1093695525555f079c.webm?t=1731399635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061300/extras/eb53668452642e1093695525555f079c.mp4?t=1731399635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
